    <briefdescription>
<para>Unified age-based migration policy for cache &amp; storage tiers. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>ThemisDB | File: <ref refid="age__based__policy_8h" kindref="compound">age_based_policy.h</ref> | Version: 2.0.0 Maturity: 🟡 ALPHA (Phase 2 Implementation) | Status: Active development Author: Copilot | Date: 2026-08-03</para>
<para>The <computeroutput>AgeBasedPolicy</computeroutput> is the single source of truth for age-based tier migration decisions. Both cache and storage tiers use it to determine when data should be promoted to or demoted from a tier.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="access__coordinator_8h" kindref="compound">include/access_model/access_coordinator.h</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
